  - {x: 3, y: 2}
  lines:
    welcome: Woof! Welcome to the castle, Keeper!
    intro: I'm captain of the guard. Stick with me and I'll show you the ropes!
    enemies: Monsters march in from the <k>right</k>, one lane at a time...
    castle: If even one reaches the <k>castle</k> on the left, we lose!
    meter: This meter tracks the <k>waves</k>. Beat every wave to win!
    cards: These are your <k>Keeper cards</k>, the squad you picked.
    drag: Drag a Keeper onto the <k>glowing tile</k>!
    dragNudge: Go on! Press a card and slide it onto the tile.
    dragMissed: So close! Let go right on top of a tile.
    placed: Pawsome! <k>{name}</k> is on guard!
    cardRests: While a Keeper is out, their card <k>rests</k>. If they fall, it <k>recharges</k>
      first.
    second: Let's cover another lane. Drag in one more Keeper!
    secondPlaced: Two lanes guarded. You're a natural!
    relocate: Need to move someone? Tap the <k>move</k> button.
    relocateDrag: Now drag your Keeper to a <k>new tile</k>!
    relocateDone: Nice footwork!
    relocateMissed: Hold on to them and drop them on an <k>empty</k> tile.
    relocateGiveUp: No worries, you'll get the hang of it. Onward!
    pause: Need a breather? Tap <k>pause</k> any time.
    go: Here they come! Hold the line, Keeper!
    skipped: Good luck out there, Keeper!
    firstKill: Got one! Woof!
    keeperDown: Ouch! Their card will recharge, hang in there.
    finalWave: Final wave! Give it everything!
